        "text": "theorem matching_clock (F : Profile) {C x : ℝ} (hC : 0 < C) (hx : 0 < x) : ShapeTransition.resetClock C F.data.core.P (Real.log (matchingRadius F C * x / Xi)) = Real.log x"
